{"id":291,"slug":"band-of-outsiders","title":"Band of Outsiders","year":1964,"country":"France","duration":95,"spine":174,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/291-band-of-outsiders","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/ae260bc49b38999ae5d987f2bac9aeab/Leo6yt5ZClpT2WA4trT7idTMnGhNug_large.jpg","description":"Four years after Breathless, Jean-Luc Godard reimagined the gangster film even more radically with Band of Outsiders (Bande à part). In it, two restless young men (Sami Frey and Claude Brasseur) enlist the object of both of their fancies (Anna Karina) to help them commit a robbery—in her own home. This audacious and wildly entertaining French New Wave gem is at once sentimental and insouciant, effervescently romantic and melancholy, and it features some of Godard’s most memorable set pieces, including the headlong race through the Louvre and the unshakably cool Madison dance sequence.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jean-Luc Godard","slug":"jean-luc-godard"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Anna Karina","role":"Odile","slug":"anna-karina"},{"actor":"Claude Brasseur","role":"Arthur","slug":"claude-brasseur"},{"actor":"Sami Frey","role":"Franz","slug":"sami-frey"},{"actor":"Danièle Girard","role":"English teacher","slug":"daniele-girard"},{"actor":"Louisa Colpeyn","role":"Madame Victoria","slug":"louisa-colpeyn"},{"actor":"Ernest Menzer","role":"Arthur’s uncle","slug":"ernest-menzer"},{"actor":"Chantal Darget","role":"Arthur’s aunt","slug":"chantal-darget"},{"actor":"Georges Staquet","role":"Arthur’s cousin","slug":"georges-staquet"},{"actor":"Claude Makovski","role":"English students","slug":"claude-makovski"},{"actor":"Michèle Seghers","role":"English students","slug":"michele-seghers"},{"actor":"Jean-Claude Remoleux","role":"English students","slug":"jean-claude-remoleux"},{"actor":"Michel Delahaye","role":"School doorman","slug":"michel-delahaye"},{"actor":"Jean-Luc Godard","role":"Narrator","slug":"jean-luc-godard"}],"credits":[{"role